# P1 swept 0 -> 255 over a held chord (chord track, P2 128): single pings on the notes, a sparkling particle cloud,
# fizzing tonal noise, the saws coming in one by one, then the twelve-saw drone. Even level.
tempo 120
steps 40
tail 2.0
track chord
preset 0 128 0 64 255 40 0 0 128 0 128 170 0 128 100 255 0 0
note 0 C3 40 110
note 0 G3 40 110
note 0 E4 40 110
sweep p1 0 255 2 38
expect sound 0 40
expect idle 60
expect peak_below -2
